WEBVTT

00:03.230 --> 00:04.310
I see.

00:06.310 --> 00:08.520
I understand what you're trying to say.

00:08.520 --> 00:10.770
So, please!

00:10.770 --> 00:13.600
Let us do an Orchestra.

00:15.560 --> 00:17.730
I guess you really are sisters.

00:18.770 --> 00:20.190
Huh?

00:20.190 --> 00:23.600
Everything about you reminds me of Eliza.

00:24.890 --> 00:28.350
Director, do you...

00:28.350 --> 00:31.230
Who do you think I am?

00:31.230 --> 00:36.640
I'm sorry... I actually don't know
much about Ray.

00:36.640 --> 00:38.980
Eliza didn't mention anything?

00:38.980 --> 00:45.060
Nothing in detail. She did show me
some magic and sing me songs.

00:45.060 --> 00:47.230
That sounds like Eliza.

00:47.230 --> 00:48.700
But...

00:48.890 --> 00:52.770
Whenever she did, she was really lovely!

00:52.770 --> 00:54.600
I see.

00:54.600 --> 00:57.440
What kind of unit was Ray?

00:57.440 --> 00:59.980
I guess I can tell you a little story...

01:01.980 --> 01:03.850
...about the past.

01:13.850 --> 01:16.350
Eliza! Eliza!

01:16.350 --> 01:18.640
Hey, let's go get some tea!

01:18.640 --> 01:21.560
Our souls need to be
quenched with sweet liquid.

01:21.560 --> 01:24.480
Knowing when to take a break
is important. Right, Eliza?

01:26.390 --> 01:28.600
I guess you're right.

01:28.600 --> 01:30.520
With Eliza at our centre, we had

01:30.520 --> 01:31.600
Camilla,

01:31.600 --> 01:32.810
Angers,

01:32.810 --> 01:33.980
Yuzuriha,

01:33.980 --> 01:35.640
and myself.

01:35.640 --> 01:38.980
The five of us formed the unit, Ray.

01:42.390 --> 01:45.140
Tea time is always so relaxing.

01:45.140 --> 01:47.350
I swear, you're an old hag, Yuzuriha.

01:47.350 --> 01:48.980
Who are you calling an old hag?!

01:48.980 --> 01:51.350
Well, you are the oldest.

01:51.350 --> 01:57.520
I'm the same age as you!
And you definitely look much older than me.

01:57.520 --> 02:01.440
And I look and feel angelically
younger than you two.

02:02.770 --> 02:06.270
Everyone knows that I'm totes
the cutest little angel in Ray.

02:06.270 --> 02:12.060
Putting "totes" aside... Our Orchestra
the other day was quite the success.

02:12.060 --> 02:14.230
Well, what did you expect?

02:14.230 --> 02:17.060
Camilla, carelessness is our greatest foe!

02:17.060 --> 02:20.140
Darkness encroaches...
upon this material world!

02:20.140 --> 02:22.980
Yeah, yeah, I know.

02:22.980 --> 02:24.810
Hey, everyone.

02:24.810 --> 02:29.390
I created some new magic, so I was
wondering if I could try it out next time.

02:29.390 --> 02:32.230
You and your research.

02:32.230 --> 02:33.690
Ooh, what's it like?

02:36.230 --> 02:37.390
Just watch.

02:42.810 --> 02:43.810
There!

02:47.140 --> 02:49.310
Wow, impressive.

02:49.310 --> 02:50.690
This looks great.

02:50.690 --> 02:52.480
That's so angelically pretty!

02:52.480 --> 02:55.110
The calmness of the dawn's light has bloomed.

02:55.110 --> 02:58.230
Wow, that's amazing!

02:58.230 --> 03:01.020
I thought my little sister would love this.

03:01.020 --> 03:03.690
And there it is.

03:03.690 --> 03:06.310
You with your little sister.

03:06.310 --> 03:08.600
You always talk about her.

03:08.600 --> 03:10.560
Nothing is more beautiful than a song of love.

03:15.560 --> 03:19.440
She's shown me that magic before!

03:19.440 --> 03:22.770
She would make flowers of light dance.
It was so pretty!

03:22.770 --> 03:25.140
I'm glad to hear it.

03:25.140 --> 03:29.140
This picture is of Ray
when we used that magic

03:29.140 --> 03:31.270
with the falling flowers in an Orchestra.

03:32.690 --> 03:34.770
This is Ray...?

03:36.640 --> 03:38.390
Director...

03:38.390 --> 03:40.730
You seem a bit different.

03:42.560 --> 03:44.270
We don't need to discuss me right now.

03:44.270 --> 03:48.810
Everyone was rather bizarre...
er, rather unique in our unit.

03:49.310 --> 03:51.270
Camilla-sama!

03:51.270 --> 03:53.810
Camilla is a vampire.
A type of demihuman.

03:51.270 --> 03:53.810
You're so amazing!

03:58.890 --> 04:01.980
Hit me, too!

04:01.980 --> 04:05.730
Silence, peasants!
You're getting in the way of my game!

04:05.730 --> 04:09.230
Because she never gets tired or even sweats,

04:09.230 --> 04:12.810
she was called the Immaculate Prince.

04:12.810 --> 04:14.560
Honestly, she was just a narcissist.

04:17.640 --> 04:20.440
With her keen insight and concentration,

04:20.440 --> 04:22.770
Yuzuriha was always an elegant dancer.

04:22.770 --> 04:25.520
People called her
the Graceful Dancing Princess.

04:29.730 --> 04:31.690
Here you go.

04:31.690 --> 04:34.270
Ah, thank you.

04:34.270 --> 04:36.560
I offer you my greatest gratitude.

04:37.440 --> 04:38.350
Hey!

04:38.350 --> 04:40.230
Yuzuriha-san, did you—

04:41.190 --> 04:42.640
What's the matter?

04:45.600 --> 04:48.190
We're just getting to know
each other a little better.

04:49.850 --> 04:54.230
Well? How about we head to the Cabaret?

04:54.230 --> 04:55.270
Okay...

04:56.440 --> 04:58.980
She had, uh, very particular interests...

05:01.060 --> 05:04.690
Can I pwease have one again?

05:04.690 --> 05:07.560
You're always so cute, Angers-chan.

05:09.850 --> 05:13.350
Angers was considered a child prodigy

05:13.350 --> 05:16.230
and had almost as much potential as Eliza.

05:20.190 --> 05:21.890
Hello, hello!

05:21.890 --> 05:25.730
Oh, it's you, Angers-chan.

05:25.730 --> 05:27.190
What's wrong?

05:27.190 --> 05:32.690
Well, I was trying to carry some
things when my knee...

05:32.690 --> 05:36.100
Then leave it to me!

05:36.100 --> 05:37.770
Hup.

05:37.770 --> 05:41.890
Angel, angel, lu, lu, lu, lu, lu!

05:46.140 --> 05:47.440
How's that?

05:47.440 --> 05:51.480
I feel much better! Thank you.

05:51.480 --> 05:53.350
That's angelically great!

05:53.350 --> 05:55.270
Could you help me out, too?

05:55.270 --> 05:56.190
Huh?

05:56.190 --> 05:58.770
My wife got a bit angry.

05:58.770 --> 06:00.560
I drank way too much last night.

06:00.560 --> 06:04.100
My stomach hurts.
My head hurts so bad...

06:04.100 --> 06:07.350
And I—
No rush, no rush!

06:07.350 --> 06:10.440
Everyone'll get their turn!

06:11.520 --> 06:15.390
She was so sweet and innocent.
Everyone loved her.

06:15.390 --> 06:19.350
Her nickname was the Little Archangel.

06:21.350 --> 06:25.350
Angel... That's really nice.

06:25.350 --> 06:26.480
And...

06:29.520 --> 06:30.770
Ow...

06:30.770 --> 06:33.350
Angelica?! What are you doing?

06:33.350 --> 06:34.810
She's Angers.

06:38.940 --> 06:42.980
Angelica is actually
the Little Archangel Angers.

06:42.980 --> 06:45.350
Wait... what?

06:48.600 --> 06:50.190
What?!

06:50.190 --> 06:51.190
Tch.

06:56.560 --> 06:58.520
What are you looking at?

06:58.520 --> 07:00.140
Oh, nothing...

07:00.140 --> 07:03.600
It's because she's having a hard time
connecting you with Angers.

07:03.600 --> 07:06.810
What?! You're the one
who spilled the beans!

07:06.810 --> 07:08.810
That's what you get for eavesdropping.

07:08.810 --> 07:10.270
Whaddya say?!

07:10.270 --> 07:13.560
Oh? Do you have a problem
with me, the director?

07:14.480 --> 07:17.140
So she really is Ray's...

07:18.520 --> 07:24.890
Tch. Don't tell anyone. The only other one
that knows about this is Luci.

07:25.980 --> 07:30.390
Promise the great Archangel Angers.

07:32.980 --> 07:34.600
Okay...

07:34.600 --> 07:36.020
You just laughed, didn't you?

07:36.020 --> 07:36.680
No.

07:36.680 --> 07:38.350
You're lying! You totally laughed!

07:38.350 --> 07:38.900
No.

07:38.900 --> 07:39.770
You totally did.

07:39.770 --> 07:40.370
No.

07:40.370 --> 07:41.230
Then let me see your face!

07:41.230 --> 07:41.860
No way.

07:41.860 --> 07:43.640
Excuse me...

07:43.640 --> 07:45.520
But why...

07:45.520 --> 07:48.770
Just because. There's no huge reason.

07:48.770 --> 07:51.060
I guess I was just tired.

07:51.060 --> 07:53.980
I even took some time off from school,

07:53.980 --> 07:56.350
but then she had the nerve to drag me back.

07:56.350 --> 08:00.640
It would've been a shame to let
your talent go to waste like that.

08:00.640 --> 08:03.190
Though I must say even I was surprised
at how much you changed.

08:03.190 --> 08:05.770
Sh-Shut up. I'm just going through a phase.

08:06.940 --> 08:11.190
After Eliza retired from Ray, we disbanded.

08:11.190 --> 08:14.640
We're the only two left at this school.

08:14.640 --> 08:19.140
The Immaculate Prince Camilla
is in Dortgart doing research on magic.

08:19.140 --> 08:23.600
The Graceful Dancing Princess Yuzuriha
is messing around in various countries...

08:23.600 --> 08:26.560
Er, learning about other
countries and their cultures.

08:26.560 --> 08:28.980
Did my sister have a nickname?

08:28.980 --> 08:33.140
Of course. Eliza's nickname
was the Scarlet Songstress.

08:35.190 --> 08:37.230
The Scarlet Songstress...

08:38.480 --> 08:40.850
That's perfect for my sister.

08:40.850 --> 08:45.060
And then we have Chloe,
the Azure Reaper from Hell!

08:45.060 --> 08:46.050
Wha—

08:46.050 --> 08:47.100
Reaper...?

08:47.100 --> 08:49.980
And she's the one who made
that nickname and spread it around!

08:49.980 --> 08:52.190
How embarrassing!

08:52.190 --> 08:54.230
That was just my youth talking...

08:55.640 --> 08:58.350
Angelica...

08:58.350 --> 09:02.230
That's what you get!
Miss Azure Reaper from Hell!

09:02.230 --> 09:04.640
Would you like to offer
your life back to God?

09:04.640 --> 09:07.020
Oh? Go ahead and try!

09:10.480 --> 09:14.640
Oh, I'm sorry. It was just
so nice watching you two.

09:17.060 --> 09:20.810
Well... Things were pretty crazy.

09:20.810 --> 09:23.440
I have nothing but good memories.

09:23.440 --> 09:25.850
And how are you doing?

09:25.850 --> 09:28.560
I'm having a lot of fun every day.

09:28.560 --> 09:30.810
Rosetta-san and the rest of your group...

09:30.810 --> 09:34.940
They reminded me of us before we had Eliza.

09:34.940 --> 09:37.600
I thought that maybe if you had joined them,

09:37.600 --> 09:40.230
they could finally be disciplined and grow.

09:40.230 --> 09:42.850
I see.

09:42.850 --> 09:44.060
And...

09:45.770 --> 09:49.890
No, I do apologize
for not giving you a choice.

09:49.890 --> 09:52.980
It's fine. I'm actually
really grateful, Director.

09:52.980 --> 09:56.230
I'm really happy being able to spend time
with such wonderful friends.

09:58.310 --> 10:03.350
And you wanted to perform an Orchestra
with those friends of yours, correct?

10:05.140 --> 10:05.890
Yes!

10:05.890 --> 10:08.230
Well, aren't you rarin' to go?

10:08.230 --> 10:11.440
If you're unable to reach
the minimum amount of points needed,

10:11.440 --> 10:13.190
you are going to be expelled.

10:13.190 --> 10:16.980
At this rate, we're going
to be expelled anyway.

10:16.980 --> 10:18.440
And...

10:18.440 --> 10:21.020
I really want to put on an Orchestra!

10:23.350 --> 10:24.730
Very well.

10:24.730 --> 10:25.940
Then...

10:25.940 --> 10:28.560
All right. I will allow you
to put on an Orchestra.

10:29.640 --> 10:31.770
Thank you so much!

10:31.770 --> 10:35.850
Please show me just how much
all of you have grown.

10:38.980 --> 10:40.560
She's been gone a while...

10:40.560 --> 10:42.640
I wonder if something happened.

10:42.640 --> 10:45.520
Is it that hard to get permission?

10:45.520 --> 10:48.310
Maybe she had to undergo some trial...

10:48.310 --> 10:49.440
Trial?

10:49.440 --> 10:51.890
You know... She may have to do this or that!

10:51.890 --> 10:53.190
This or that?

10:53.190 --> 10:54.440
Everyone!

11:01.600 --> 11:04.100
Heck yeah!

12:03.270 --> 12:05.390
Are you okay?

12:05.390 --> 12:07.190
Yesh...

12:07.190 --> 12:11.440
I'm fine... This is easy...

12:11.440 --> 12:13.980
Writing lyrics and making
costumes are both important,

12:13.980 --> 12:15.440
but don't push yourselves too hard.

12:15.440 --> 12:18.810
Yeah. You guys need to
actually sleep and feel refreshed.

12:18.810 --> 12:22.100
Yeah, you know. A well-slept child
is a well-kept child.

12:22.100 --> 12:24.980
You're amazing, Rosetta-san...

12:26.020 --> 12:29.270
You have school and your job, too...

12:29.270 --> 12:31.390
That's not a big deal.

12:31.390 --> 12:33.140
You're amazing, Rose-chan.

12:33.140 --> 12:37.020
I guess it's not surprising
your grades are as great as mine.

12:37.020 --> 12:41.390
So is there anything else
we should be preparing?

12:41.390 --> 12:42.730
Don't ask me.

12:43.770 --> 12:45.020
Well...

12:45.020 --> 12:49.350
We need to fill the sound equipment
and the lighting equipment with magic.

12:49.350 --> 12:51.270
That's right!

12:51.270 --> 12:55.810
For that, we need someone with knowledge
and technique to use Magical Mechanics...

12:55.810 --> 12:59.890
But it's rather difficult...
and we don't have much time.

12:59.890 --> 13:01.440
Oh, no...

13:02.940 --> 13:04.560
Want some help?

13:05.980 --> 13:08.940
I mean... only if you need it...

13:08.940 --> 13:11.730
Maryberry.

13:11.730 --> 13:14.100
Do you know a lot about Magical Mechanics?

13:14.100 --> 13:18.230
Yup. I'm really good with that stuff.
Leave it to me.

13:18.230 --> 13:19.890
Easy peasy!

13:20.690 --> 13:22.020
Thank you so much!

13:22.020 --> 13:24.020
That's such a big help!

13:24.020 --> 13:26.770
No, I should be thanking you.

13:27.810 --> 13:31.390
You all helped me out the other day...

13:32.890 --> 13:35.190
Mary!

13:35.190 --> 13:37.730
Maybe they'll help, too.

13:40.850 --> 13:44.140
These should all help.

13:44.140 --> 13:46.520
This might be a bit much.

13:46.520 --> 13:50.190
Wow, you have a lot going on.

13:50.190 --> 13:51.600
Kaede-san.

13:51.600 --> 13:53.810
What in the world are you doing?

14:33.810 --> 14:36.310
I guess I don't need to do anything.

14:37.520 --> 14:40.230
You seem a bit jealous.

14:40.230 --> 14:42.600
Luci! How long have you been there?!

14:42.600 --> 14:47.480
Probably since a certain someone
looked like she wanted to join in.

14:47.480 --> 14:50.230
That's not it at all!

14:50.230 --> 14:52.390
So how are they doing?

14:52.390 --> 14:55.850
Who knows? It seems they've
got stuff figured out.

14:55.850 --> 14:58.230
Well, that's good.

15:01.140 --> 15:05.140
It's always rough in the beginning.

15:09.480 --> 15:13.980
All right, class.
Today is the last day of this term,

15:13.980 --> 15:17.140
but always remember that
you're witches and act responsibly.

15:17.140 --> 15:19.730
Always be the shining light
for those around you.

15:21.190 --> 15:26.600
Flora-sama is always watching over
the stars, the earth, and everything else.

15:34.940 --> 15:37.100
It's finally time.

15:37.100 --> 15:39.890
Yeah... We did everything we could.

15:39.890 --> 15:42.520
I'm so done with studying!

15:42.520 --> 15:44.350
All we have left is the Orchestra.

15:45.980 --> 15:48.100
No, not yet.

15:49.850 --> 15:51.850
Why don't we decide a name for our unit?

15:51.850 --> 15:53.560
Oh, a name...

15:53.560 --> 15:55.560
Is that really necessary?

15:55.560 --> 15:59.980
It's not absolutely necessary,
but if we had one...

15:59.980 --> 16:02.890
I think I'd be even more hyped up
if we had a cool name.

16:02.890 --> 16:04.020
That's true.

16:04.020 --> 16:05.060
Then let's pick one.

16:05.060 --> 16:06.440
Yeah!

16:16.520 --> 16:18.690
Or so we said...

16:18.690 --> 16:21.690
Names are hard.

16:21.690 --> 16:25.520
Um... How about "Charming Five"?

16:25.520 --> 16:28.350
It has a nice ring to it, don't you think?

16:28.350 --> 16:30.690
Yeah, that's just not it.

16:30.690 --> 16:33.060
What about Hustle Five?

16:33.060 --> 16:34.850
Super Ultra Five, maybe?

16:34.850 --> 16:37.890
Pretty Five GOGO?

16:35.940 --> 16:37.890
Hold on, everyone!

16:37.890 --> 16:39.980
First, let's drop the "Five."

16:39.980 --> 16:41.770
You sure?

16:41.770 --> 16:43.730
What to do...

16:43.730 --> 16:46.480
I know! How about
Lavie-chan and her Merry Little Fri—

16:47.350 --> 16:49.350
Get serious.

16:49.350 --> 16:51.810
Well, you guys are taking too long.

16:51.810 --> 16:53.730
That's not an excuse for you to fool around.

16:53.730 --> 16:55.390
The sun's going down soon...

16:55.390 --> 16:56.770
What should we do?

17:09.810 --> 17:12.690
I just remembered...

17:12.690 --> 17:13.980
Yes.

17:13.980 --> 17:15.980
Wait, what?

17:15.980 --> 17:20.350
The day I came to the academy,
I looked down on the town from here.

17:20.350 --> 17:23.100
The light from the Shiny Stones was so pretty.

17:24.560 --> 17:28.640
But now, it looks even more brilliant.

17:30.310 --> 17:32.140
Maybe it's because I'm with all of you.

17:35.480 --> 17:38.890
I always wanted to be the light...

17:40.600 --> 17:43.810
...to shine down on the town, the people...

17:47.980 --> 17:49.810
That's it, Tiara-san!

17:51.690 --> 17:53.190
Our unit name!

18:07.270 --> 18:08.600
It's finally time.

18:08.600 --> 18:11.060
It's Lynette and her friends' time to shine!

18:11.060 --> 18:13.060
It's so exciting.

18:13.060 --> 18:14.140
Yeah!

18:14.440 --> 18:16.640
But they're going to be expelled
if they fail, right?

18:16.640 --> 18:22.270
If they can't fill the tower more
than 72%, to be precise.

18:22.270 --> 18:23.600
Which means...

18:23.600 --> 18:28.020
If they can get the Metrics Tower
to turn yellow, they should be okay.

18:28.020 --> 18:31.440
What do you think will happen, Emilia-san?

18:31.440 --> 18:34.140
I'm not sure.

18:34.140 --> 18:36.850
Eliza-sama's little sister
is doing an Orchestra...

18:36.850 --> 18:38.060
How exciting.

18:38.060 --> 18:40.640
Right, Yue?

18:40.640 --> 18:42.560
Hey, is it starting yet?

18:42.560 --> 18:44.190
Yeah, they are a bit late.

18:44.190 --> 18:46.100
When's this thing starting?

18:46.100 --> 18:48.060
I wonder if something happened.

18:48.060 --> 18:50.390
This is the district for today, right?

18:50.390 --> 18:52.100
It should be...

18:52.100 --> 18:53.890
Making us wait is a part of rock and roll, too.

18:55.940 --> 18:57.810
Behind us!

18:57.810 --> 19:00.020
Sorry to keep you waiting, everyone!

19:00.020 --> 19:03.600
We're performing our first Orchestra tonight!

19:03.600 --> 19:04.940
But...

19:04.940 --> 19:07.190
Let's not sweat the small things.

19:07.190 --> 19:09.020
Let's all have fun...

19:09.020 --> 19:10.890
...to our hearts' content!

19:10.890 --> 19:14.060
We'll be the light that
shines down on everyone!

19:14.060 --> 19:15.730
We are...

19:15.730 --> 19:16.980
...LiGHTs!

19:17.700 --> 19:21.390
seven hundred sextillion no sora de

19:17.700 --> 19:21.390
In a sky of 700 sextillion

19:17.700 --> 19:21.390
700,000,000,000,000,000,000,000

19:21.390 --> 19:27.040
kinou made no yume wo koe ni shite

19:21.390 --> 19:27.040
The dream that lasted till yesterday, voice it all out

19:25.810 --> 19:27.020
What?

19:27.350 --> 19:28.890
Wait, why are they splitting up?

19:28.890 --> 19:30.810
Wait, are they going to do this while moving?

19:32.730 --> 19:34.440
An Orchestra?

19:34.440 --> 19:35.770
We should go, too!

19:38.130 --> 19:41.390
mune ni wakidashita yuuki ga

19:38.130 --> 19:41.390
Even if the courage that springs out from your chest

19:41.390 --> 19:45.740
osanakute chipoke de kowakute mo

19:41.390 --> 19:45.740
Is small and easily scared

19:45.740 --> 19:48.500
furuete iru dake nara

19:45.740 --> 19:48.500
If it's just the tremble

19:49.000 --> 19:52.700
sugu kiete itte shimau kara

19:49.000 --> 19:52.700
Then it will be gone soon

19:52.700 --> 19:56.170
aruite ikeru hazu no michi de

19:52.700 --> 19:56.170
On the path that you should be able to walk on

19:56.170 --> 19:57.910
fuan no kakera

19:56.170 --> 19:57.910
Even if anxiety's remnants

19:57.910 --> 20:00.300
ni tsumazuite mo

19:57.910 --> 20:00.300
trip you up

20:00.300 --> 20:04.870
hirotte dakishimete saa susumou

20:00.300 --> 20:04.870
Pick them up, hold them tight, Let's move forward

20:04.870 --> 20:06.830
3 2 1 Jump!

20:06.830 --> 20:10.090
seven hundred sextillion no sora de

20:06.830 --> 20:10.090
In a sky of 700 sextillion

20:10.090 --> 20:13.780
soko ga start tte kidzuitara

20:10.090 --> 20:13.780
If you realize that the start is there

20:13.780 --> 20:16.830
hashiridashitai shunkan wo

20:13.780 --> 20:16.830
That moment when you want to start running,

20:16.830 --> 20:20.520
saa (saa) tsukamaete

20:16.830 --> 20:20.520
Now (now) grab hold of it

20:20.520 --> 20:24.000
rokusen-nichi-me no itsumo no sora

20:20.520 --> 20:24.000
It's the usual sky on the 6,000th day

20:24.000 --> 20:27.260
dakedo kyou kakikaetara

20:24.000 --> 20:27.260
But if you were to redraw it today

20:27.260 --> 20:30.960
kitto itsuka (sono ippo ga)

20:27.260 --> 20:30.960
Then someday (That first step)

20:30.960 --> 20:33.350
kimi no sora ni kakaru

20:30.960 --> 20:36.610
Will become a rainbow over your sky

20:33.350 --> 20:36.610
niji ni naru

20:36.610 --> 20:40.090
We just fly to you

20:36.610 --> 20:40.090
we just fly to you

20:40.090 --> 20:45.300
And just sing for you

20:40.090 --> 20:45.300
and just sing for you

20:54.100 --> 20:55.480
Nice! Great job!

20:55.480 --> 20:57.350
They're so energetic!

20:57.350 --> 21:00.350
That was amazing. Wasn't it, Yue?

21:02.100 --> 21:06.770
Well... I guess I can
acknowledge her a little bit.

21:05.700 --> 21:15.600
mado no soto wa yasashii tsukiakari sotto

21:05.700 --> 21:15.600
Outside the window, the gentle moonlight is shining softly

21:06.770 --> 21:08.310
Oh, Yue...

21:08.310 --> 21:10.140
Be honest with yourself.

21:11.730 --> 21:13.520
That felt great!

21:13.520 --> 21:14.940
I let it all out!

21:15.600 --> 21:24.300
akari keshite yume no hashi wo watarou

21:15.600 --> 21:24.300
Put out the lights and cross the bridge of dreams

21:16.810 --> 21:18.020
Wait, the tower!

21:21.310 --> 21:23.810
It's yellow... right?

21:23.810 --> 21:25.350
Yeah.

21:24.300 --> 21:29.100
kie soude kienai hikari ga ima

21:24.300 --> 21:29.100
The weakening yet everlasting light is now

21:25.350 --> 21:27.020
That means...

21:27.020 --> 21:28.140
That we...

21:29.100 --> 21:33.900
mabuta no mukou no sekai ni hirogatta

21:29.100 --> 21:33.900
Spreading out into the world behind my eyelids

21:30.230 --> 21:32.390
We did it!

21:33.900 --> 21:36.600
ironna omoi ga afurete

21:33.900 --> 21:36.600
Various feelings are overflowing

21:34.690 --> 21:36.020
Oh-ho...

21:36.020 --> 21:37.850
Not half bad.

21:36.600 --> 21:40.350
kirakira mabushiku kagayaiteru

21:36.600 --> 21:40.350
sparklingly and dazzlingly shining

21:40.350 --> 21:43.500
zutto

21:40.350 --> 21:43.500
Forever

21:43.500 --> 21:45.600
It's shining stars

21:45.600 --> 21:50.400
ashita wa donna hi ni naru kana

21:45.600 --> 21:50.400
I wonder what kind of day tomorrow will be

21:50.400 --> 21:55.500
kokoro ni utsushidasu keshiki wa

21:50.400 --> 21:55.500
The scenery that is reflected in my heart

21:55.500 --> 22:00.450
kitai namida yume no zenbu ga kasanatta

21:55.500 --> 22:00.450
Expectations, tears, and dreams, all of it bottled up in my heart

22:00.450 --> 22:04.050
watashi no planetarium

22:00.450 --> 22:04.050
My planetarium

22:04.050 --> 22:04.800
hora

22:04.050 --> 22:09.900
Look, in that star that is shining the brightest

22:04.800 --> 22:09.900
ichiban kagayaiteiru ano hoshi ni

22:09.900 --> 22:14.100
negai kakete oyasumi

22:09.900 --> 22:14.100
A wish is enclosed: "Good night"

22:24.100 --> 22:26.230
Cheers!

22:26.230 --> 22:28.310
It feels like a dream...

22:28.310 --> 22:30.980
...that we actually did an Orchestra.

22:30.980 --> 22:33.190
My heart is still pounding.

22:33.190 --> 22:36.350
I wanted to sing even more!

22:36.350 --> 22:39.520
Jeez, you're so greedy!

22:39.520 --> 22:42.480
Like you can talk.

22:42.480 --> 22:43.850
Was I that obvious?

22:43.850 --> 22:45.940
We all feel the same.

22:45.940 --> 22:49.560
We're not being expelled now,
so let's do that again.

22:49.560 --> 22:52.640
Yeah, we should.

22:52.640 --> 22:56.190
By the way, who used that last bit of magic?

22:56.190 --> 22:58.140
That was Tiara-san, wasn't it?

22:58.140 --> 22:59.940
Huh? Me?

22:59.940 --> 23:03.270
Oh, there you are.
Now I don't have to go to your rooms.

23:03.270 --> 23:04.310
What's the matter?

23:04.310 --> 23:05.980
I have a message for you guys.

23:05.980 --> 23:07.520
At this hour?

23:07.520 --> 23:08.980
Express mail.

23:08.980 --> 23:10.520
Thanks.

23:10.520 --> 23:11.850
Well, see ya.

23:11.850 --> 23:12.980
Thanks again.

23:12.980 --> 23:14.230
Great work!

23:14.230 --> 23:15.310
I wonder what it is.

23:15.310 --> 23:19.730
Maybe we're being promoted
to Rouge because we did so well!

23:19.730 --> 23:22.100
It can't be that easy.

23:23.640 --> 23:24.890
What?!

23:28.310 --> 23:30.980
Today's Orchestra...

23:32.730 --> 23:37.310
Figures from districts that weren't
supposed to be measured were included...
